    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i just got started on a new med for my depression (it's an MAOI) and my doctor said i need to watch what i eat. i'm trying to do a really high protein diet to stay healthy though... is it okay if i keep eating things like aged cheddar, salami, and use soy sauce for flavor? just want to make sure i'm getting enough nutrients.",
