      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Hello! While you're aiming for a high-protein diet, it's crucial to avoid certain foods and high-sodium condiments when taking MAOIs. Aged cheeses, cured meats like salami, and soy sauce can interact with your medication and may cause serious side effects like high blood pressure or serotonin syndrome. It's best to focus on fresh, lean protein sources and consult with your healthcare provider or a dietitian for safe dietary guidance.",
