    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "oh wow i didn't realize it was that serious. i was actually planning a meal prep for the week though and i have a lot of extra parmesan and some prosciutto in the fridge. if I just eat small amounts instead of a big plate, is it still a huge deal? i really don't want to waste the food if i can just moderate it.",
