    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay i get it. so if i just stick to fresh chicken, eggs, and maybe some yogurt for protein, i'm totally fine? i noticed some people online say yogurt is okay as long as it's not fermented with yeast or anything weird. just want a solid list of what i *can* eat so i don't have to keep worrying about every single bite.",
